 "integration": {
  "summary": "Write NetworkCtrl to run or stop the unit, set summer/winter with SuWiNetworkChgover after setting SuWiChgSrc to BMS, and adjust the fan, temperature and humidity setpoints as needed. Read the operating mode and status, supply and controlled temperatures, ERQ load and the general alarm.",
